('gakh',NULL,'Baku','Baku','77',77,'Day Trip',NULL,NULL,NULL,'08:00 – Leaving Baku to Gakh (1 way x 5 hrs)   13:00 – Lunch Break   14:00 – Visit Ilisu Village  - Ilisu is a historic mountain village known for its stone houses, fresh air, waterfalls, and panoramic views. The village reflects preserved Caucasian architecture and traditional lifestyle.   15:00 – Visit Ulu Mosque (Ilisu Mosque)  - Dating back to the 16th century, this mosque is an important cultural and religious landmark of the region and one of the oldest preserved Islamic structures in Gakh.   16:00 – Visit Sumug Gala (Defensive Tower)  - A medieval defensive tower once used to guard Ilisu and monitor strategic mountain routes. Today it stands as a symbol of local heritage and offers scenic photo points.   16:30 – Leaving Gakh to Baku   21:00 – Dinner Break (if included)   22:00 – Drop to the Hotel   Overnight in Baku',NULL,NULL,'Sedan - 4 Seaters (Local Speaking)',77.0),
