('ismayilli',NULL,'Gabala','Gabala','30',30,'Day Trip',NULL,NULL,NULL,'09:00 – Leaving Gabala to Ismayilli (1 way x 1.5 hrs)   10:45 – Visit Lahij Village (Optional)  - Lahij is a historic mountain village famous for its cobbled streets, traditional handicrafts (copperware, carpets), and stone architecture. Visitors can see artisans at work, buy souvenirs, and enjoy panoramic mountain views.   12:15 – Explore Ismayilli City / Nature Spots  Visit local parks, rivers, or small mountain trails around Ismayilli. Optional short lunch stop in a local restaurant to taste Azerbaijani cuisine.   14:30 – Lunch Break 15:30 – Visit Basgal Village (Optional)  Another charming village nearby, known for its history and traditional craft workshops.   16:00 – Depart from Ismayilli back to Gabala    17:30 – Arrive back in Gabala   18:00 - Dinner break (if included)   19:00 - Drop to the Hotel Overnight in Gabala',NULL,NULL,'Sedan - 4 Seaters (Local Speaking)',30.0),
